# Design

## 概述

Retain original_inline.py byte-for-byte and invoke original pretag_driver/worker in a separately frozen worker facade. A temporary Path.open hook only wraps xb named-events files under one explicitly owned directory. Ordinary files remain untouched. Its original worker event/Recorder and pretag_driver AST remain exact because instrumentation sits outside all original functions. Observation sidecars use saved original Path.open and cannot recurse through the hook.

## 技术方案

A call captures before-observation error, always delegates once, captures after-observation error even on failed delegates and reraises the exact original exception. Ordinary observation exceptions set sticky observer failure and allow the real delegate to finish; BaseException cancellation is rethrown after delegation and cannot be swallowed. close is always delegated even when its before observer fails. The hook is scoped and restored in finally.

The new external supervisor and read-only prepare_preflight are implemented. Startup still requires independent peer review of the exact prepared source/runtime/native/refs packet and current executable seal. The review-only invocation material is not itself startup approval. Deadline1200, retirement7, family2, reader2 and stdout2MiB remain frozen. A live/unstarted reader never receives blocking close. Missing retirement/observer evidence remains UNKNOWN/FAIL.

## 文件结构

work/pretag303 contains original_inline.py, external observer source, ordinary controls and safe status. docs/specs/pretag303-event-diagnostic contains these3 specifications. Source restoration remains exact8 separate from adapter.

对应需求：FR-1、FR-2、FR-3、FR-4、FR-5。Original context body exception/cancellation survives successful real close even when close observations cancel; observer cancellation remains recorded in sticky errors and makes diagnostic facade nonzero, and it is never converted to success; actual real close exceptions retain original precedence. Fresh impact is UNKNOWN/manual HIGH disclosed for this new boundary.

Natural same-run adopted-family admission is a new supervisor predicate: ECHILD is necessary but each saved native wait outcome must be CLD_EXITED/status0. Actual cleanup of an escaped live child via SIGKILL remains cleanup-only and cannot produce natural PASS. This does not change the original owned_family_close AST or budgets.
